    "Tags": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tags"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The card was not modified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carte n'a pas été modifiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The checksum is computed while writing, then read back from the written file. The card is never modified.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empreinte calculée pendant l'écriture puis relue sur le fichier écrit. La carte n'est jamais modifiée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The interface language is read once, when the app starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La langue de l'interface est lue une seule fois, au démarrage de l'app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library is being read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bibliothèque est en cours de lecture."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This camera does not allow clips to be read in chunks. Use the card in a reader.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette caméra ne permet pas de lire les clips par morceaux. Utilisez la carte dans un lecteur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To read a card in a reader. macOS asks the first time one is inserted; without it, the card looks empty.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour lire une carte insérée dans un lecteur. macOS la demande au premier branchement ; sans elle, la carte paraît vide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transfer": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transfert"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Verification": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where should imported clips go?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Où ranger les clips importés ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whole library": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toute la bibliothèque"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without confirmation, plugging the card in starts the copy right away. The guard that matters is elsewhere: a card with no DCIM/###GOPRO folder is never touched, setting or no setting.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans confirmation, brancher la carte lance la copie tout de suite. La garde qui compte est ailleurs : une carte sans dossier DCIM/###GOPRO n'est jamais touchée, réglage ou pas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your GoPro is plugged in, but macOS is stopping QuiX from talking to it. It has to be allowed under “Local Network”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre GoPro est branchée, mais macOS empêche QuiX de lui parler. Il faut l'autoriser dans « Réseau local »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your GoPro is plugged in, but macOS is stopping QuiX from talking to it. Over USB-C the camera is a network device: QuiX has to be allowed under “Local Network”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre GoPro est branchée, mais macOS empêche QuiX de lui parler. Branchée en USB-C, la caméra est un périphérique réseau : il faut autoriser QuiX dans « Réseau local »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "asked when needed": {
